d you've got Bernie  Sanders who's running a campaign that  seems to be fighting not just the  Republicans but also the traditional  democratic party elected officials you  know a lot of the Bernie bros online  I've been learning after  african-americans in South Carolina Ava  Duvernay even had any notes took on some  water from some of this crowd Bernie  Sanders has to decide is he more  interested in beating Donald Trump or  more interested in beating traditional  he's leading in Texas and California in  California substantially two biggest  states almost half the delegates today  what do you think is gonna happen oh I  would expect Bernie Sanders would get to  win California again let's pay attention  to the margins is he growing his  population is he bringing in these new  voters that he's been talking about and  growing that number also is he or is he  winning over some of the traditional  Democrats when he's invited last night  he him this is a good line he invited an  Amy Klobuchar and P boudoir judges  campaign supporters to come and join him  if that's happening then they'll see  Bernie Sanders grows coalition and  that's the path to victory not fighting  traditional Valeri we have to pay  attention to Bernie Sanders supporters  do we not because we're speaking very  loudly not only are they loud but they  vote they turn out they have a lot of  energy and so yes I think but that's  that's kind of my point we need a big  ten week  leave anybody behind if we actually want  to win in November and that's the eye on  the prize I think that's where Mayor  Bloomberg that's why he got in the race  he was worried about President Trump he  was worried was there somebody viable in  the field and so I think all of them are  gonna eventually pull ranks and focus on  how to build a big tent so that we can  win in November  Elizabeth Warren Valerie do you think  there's a path so for her I wouldn't  write her out look the last time I was  here everybody was discounting Vice  President Biden so she is a force of  nature she's a good campaigner she's a  strong strong candidate  it's important that she have a good  night tonight all right thank you both  thank you come back and chew anytime  this story has many legs Valerie Jarrett  and Jamal Simmons always welcome

